*  CLM R1,B'0010',SEGPAGE COMPARED BYTE 2 OF A VIRTUAL         XA0036DK         
*  ADDRESS -- PAGE-WITHIN-SEGMENT TIMES 16 -- AGAINST BYTE 0   XA0036DK         
*  OF THE STE, WHICH WAS (PAGES-1) TIMES 16. THE SAME          XA0036DK         
*  ENCODING BY ACCIDENT, SO ONE BYTE COMPARE TESTED FOR THE    XA0036DK         
*  END OF THE PAGE TABLE. NOTHING LINES UP IN ESA/390: THE     XA0036DK         
*  PAGE FIELD IS EIGHT BITS AT 12-19 AND PTL COUNTS SIXTEENS   XA0036DK         
